.#-----------------------------------------------------
.input|xhtml/1.0
.# Groups coming from HTML (e.g. from the WYSIWYG editor). Since Markdown tables can't contain blocks, only the
.# content of a Group located in a table cell is rendered.
.#-----------------------------------------------------
<html><body><div class="box infomessage"><p>info</p></div><ul><li>item<div class="d">block</div>after</li></ul><table><tr><td>cell<div class="t">in cell</div></td></tr></table></body></html>
.#-----------------------------------------------------
.expect|markdown/1.2
.#-----------------------------------------------------
<div class="box infomessage">

info

</div>

* item

  <div class="d">

  block

  </div>

  after

| ------------- |
| cell

in cell |
